                                                                -*- outline -*-
* Bred

A personal editor, built on CodeMirror. Everything below is an outline
heading; fold any heading from the gutter to collapse its section.

** Getting Started

*** Installation

Bred runs out of a git checkout — always a development build. No packaging.

*** Opening files

Use the file commands to open a buffer, or the samples buffer to browse
these examples. Any buffer can be switched to Outline mode with:

    M-x outline mode

**** Editing

Point motion, marks, and regions work as in any Ed mode buffer.

**** Saving

Save with the usual save command. Modified buffers show a save icon.

** Folding

*** Fold gutter

Each foldable heading shows a marker in the gutter. Click it to fold or
unfold the section. A folded heading keeps its text and shows a "…"
placeholder after it.

**** Nested sections

Fold a level one heading and every deeper heading under it folds too.

***** Deeper still

Fold from here and only this section collapses.

****** Even deeper

Six stars is the deepest level shown by the highlighting.

** Example outline

*** Level two section

Content at the second level.

**** Level three section

Content at the third level.

**** Level three, again

Sibling section at the same level — folding either one stops here.

*** Level two, again

Folding this level two section only hides its own children.

* Second top level

A sibling of "Bred": folding "Bred" stops before this heading.
